<title>CANADA: CWB details top Canadian durum importers 1995/96.</title>
<headline>CWB details top Canadian durum importers 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Thursday listed its largest durum wheat clients in marketing year 1995/96 (Aug/July).</p>
<p>COUNTRY	WHEAT (millions of tonnes)</p>
<p>Algeria	  1.13</p>
<p>Libya	    0.97</p>
<p>Tunisia	  0.85</p>
<p>Peru	     0.73</p>
<p>Belgium	  0.28</p>
<p>Italy	    0.27</p>
<p>Morocco	  0.22</p>
<p>Venezuela	0.21</p>
<p>United States  0.18 Japan	    0.15</p>
<p>Chile	    0.10</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
